---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Platen privacy policy (draft stub)."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Draft stub — replace with legal review before public signup.</p>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        We collect account information (name, email, restaurant details) and usage data needed to
        operate Platen (sessions, menu content, scan metrics).
      </p>
      <p>
        Public menu pages are visible to anyone with the link or QR. Do not publish personal data you
        do not intend to share.
      </p>
      <p>
        We use processors for hosting, email, and storage. Data retention and deletion requests will
        be documented when self-serve accounts go live.
      </p>
      <p>
        Contact: privacy details will be published with the production launch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
